            "npi": "1427202845",
            "practice_type": "Private practice",
            "joined": "2025",
            "summary": "Supports eye comfort during screen time and antioxidant balance",
            "message": "<p>If you spend most of your workday staring at screens, you may have noticed your eyes sometimes feel tired or strained by evening. When patients deal with this kind of eye discomfort, I recommend an astaxanthin supplement like this one from Rovina because it may ease the oxidative load on the eyes. One human trial has even shown that this active ingredient may help maintain visual sharpness during heavy screen work. The astaxanthin here comes from microalgae and may have antioxidant properties, which research suggests could have positive effects on markers of inflammation more broadly.*</p>",
            "citation_pill": "Journal of Clinical … +1",
            "citations": "Effects of diet containing astaxanthin on visual function in healthy individuals | Journal of Clinical Biochemistry and Nutrition, 2022\nAstaxanthin decreased oxidative stress and inflammation and enhanced immune response in humans | Nutrition and Metabolism, 2010",
            "highlights_label": "Highlights:",
            "highlights": "Screen fatigue\nOxidative defense\nAll-around support",
            "show_more_label": "Show more"
          }
        },
        "r2": {
          "type": "review",
