            "years": "31",
            "location": "Naples, FL",
            "preview_label": "Preview",
            "website": "https://example.com",
            "website_label": "Go to clinician website",
            "npi": "1568392011",
            "practice_type": "Private practice",
            "joined": "2024",
            "summary": "Potent antioxidant supports daily skin health and resilience",
            "message": "<p>I’d gladly recommend Rovina’s softgels to patients who want to support their skin as it ages. The primary ingredient is an antioxidant called astaxanthin, included here at 12 mg, which is similar to what’s been studied in research. Antioxidants like astaxanthin can provide support for the skin against everyday stress that can otherwise wear it down.*</p>",
            "citation_pill": "Nutrients … +1",
            "citations": "Astaxanthin and skin health | Marine Drugs, 2018\nDietary astaxanthin and skin condition | Journal of Cosmetic Dermatology, 2021",
            "highlights_label": "Highlights:",
            "highlights": "Skin resilience\nAntioxidant support\nDaily use",
            "show_more_label": "Show more"
